  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Assuming that four protons combine to form a helium nucleus and two positrons each of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>000549</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>.</mo></math>, calculate the energy released. Given, the mass of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.007825</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>.</mo></math> and mas of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mi>He</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>002603</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p>\r"
