  "solution": {
    "text": "The nuclear fusion reaction can be written as:<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mrow/><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mi>He</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math><br /><br />If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow/><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow/><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mi>He</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> represent the masses of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mrow/><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mrow/><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mi>He</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></math> nuclei respectively, then<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>14</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow/><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow/><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mi>He</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>931.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>MeV</mi></math> .....(i)<br /><br />Where <math><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></math> represents the mass of the positron <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> .<br /><br />Here, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow/><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mi>He</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>4.002603</mn></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>.</mo></math>; <math><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.0005499</mn></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>.</mo></math><br /><br />Substituting for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow/><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mi>He</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow/><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mi>He</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></math> in the equation (i), we have<br /><br /><math><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1.007825</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4.002603</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0.0000549</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>931.5</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0.027599</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>931.5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>.71</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>MeV</mi></math>"
  }
